X-WR-CALDESC:Portfolio Pilot Option 1 — YTC Revenue Sprint milestones, gate reviews, and execution checkpoints.

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-prelaunch-approvals-deadline@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260811
SUMMARY:⚠️ Pre-Launch Approvals DEADLINE
DESCRIPTION:All 7 Portfolio Pilot pre-launch approval items must be resolved before execution start on 08/17/2026.\n\nItems include:\n• YTC monetization affiliate accounts\n• Channel analytics access\n• Studio equipment audit\n• B-GAE compliance research\n• Infrastructure provisioning\n• Budget authorization ($500/mo)\n• PMO governance sign-off\n\nOpen Portfolio Pilot → Approvals to review: http://127.0.0.1:8787/Portfolio%20Pilot/approvals.html
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Approvals
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-ytc-monetization-rails@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260811
SUMMARY:🎯 YTC — Monetization Rails Must Be Live
DESCRIPTION:YouTube Creator App monetization infrastructure must be fully operational by this date:\n• Affiliate program accounts active\n• Sponsor intake form deployed\n• Lead capture / email list setup\n• Analytics dashboards configured\n\nThis is a hard prerequisite for Week 1 content publishing cadence.
CATEGORIES:YTC,Milestone
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-execution-start@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260817
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
SUMMARY:🚀 Portfolio Pilot — EXECUTION START (Week 1)
DESCRIPTION:Portfolio Pilot Option 1 — YTC Revenue Sprint begins.\n\nPlan v1 approved: May 1, 2026\nBudget cap: $500/month\nRunway: 26 months\n\nWeek 1 Priority Tasks (16 total):\n— PORTFOLIO: Finalize KPI baselines, confirm budget tracker, activate weekly pulse\n— YTC: Publish first video, activate affiliate links, test monetization rails\n— STUDIO: Define mix presets, verify turnaround SOP, document workflow\n— B-GAE: Start grant opportunity scan, define pilot concept scope\n— PMO: Stand up weekly review cadence, confirm gate criteria\n\nKPI Targets:\n• YTC: 2-3 videos/week cadence\n• Studio: 20% turnaround improvement by M1\n• B-GAE: Pilot concept ready by M3\n• Burn: ≤$500/month\n\nOrbit App: http://127.0.0.1:8787
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Execution
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-week1-end@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260823
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
SUMMARY:📋 Week 1 End — Pulse Review
DESCRIPTION:End of Week 1 (Aug 17-23). Conduct weekly pulse review:\n• All 16 Week 1 tasks status check\n• KPI baseline vs actuals\n• Any blockers or scope changes\n• Week 2 task activation\n\nYTC must have at least 1 video published this week.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Review
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-week2-end@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260831
SUMMARY:📋 Week 2 End — Pulse Review
DESCRIPTION:End of Week 2 (Aug 24-30). Weekly pulse review.\n\nYTC: Maintain 2-3 publish cadence.\nStudio: Preset workflow operational.\nMonitor: Burn rate vs $500/mo cap.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Review
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-week3-end@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260906
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260907
SUMMARY:📋 Week 3 End — Pulse Review
DESCRIPTION:End of Week 3 (Aug 31 - Sep 6). Weekly pulse review.\n\nYTC: Leading revenue indicators should be visible (views trending, CTR, affiliate click-through).\nStudio: First mix preset in production use.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Review
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-m1-gate@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260915
SUMMARY:🔴 M1 GATE REVIEW — Go/No-Go Decision
DESCRIPTION:Milestone 1 Gate Review (end of Week 4 — Sep 7-13).\n\nGO criteria (ALL must pass):\n✅ YTC: 2-3 videos/week cadence maintained\n✅ YTC: 2+ monetization channels active (affiliate, sponsor, or lead capture)\n✅ YTC: Leading revenue indicators positive (views, CTR, engagement trending up)\n✅ Studio: 20% turnaround improvement achieved\n✅ Studio: Mix preset workflow operational\n✅ Burn: ≤$500/month confirmed\n\nNO-GO triggers contingency review:\n• Reassess budget allocation\n• Evaluate pivot options\n• Aegis governance escalation\n\nDecision log must be recorded in Portfolio Pilot.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Gate Review
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-week5-end@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:📋 Week 5 End — Pulse Review
DESCRIPTION:End of Week 5 (Sep 14-20). First week post-M1 gate.\n\nYTC: Revenue signals strengthening. Begin tracking actual revenue (not just leading indicators).\nB-GAE: Grant research should be well underway.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Review
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-week6-end@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:📋 Week 6 End — Pulse Review
DESCRIPTION:End of Week 6 (Sep 21-27). Weekly pulse review.\n\nYTC: Target first paid transaction this week or next.\nStudio: Direct revenue path (mixing/editing services) should be open.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Review
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-bgae-grants-window@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:🌿 B-GAE Grant Application Window (Weeks 7-8)
DESCRIPTION:B-GAE (Algae Eater) grant application submission window.\n\nTarget opportunities identified during Weeks 1-6 research phase.\nBudget: 10% of portfolio ($150 over 90 days)\n\nCompliance research must be complete before submission.\nPilot concept documentation required with applications.
CATEGORIES:B-GAE,Grants
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-m2-gate@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:🔴 M2 GATE REVIEW + AlphaStream Unlock Decision
DESCRIPTION:Milestone 2 Gate Review (end of Week 8 — Oct 5-11).\n\nGO criteria:\n✅ YTC: First paid revenue transaction confirmed\n✅ YTC: 3+ monetization channels active\n✅ Studio: Consistent production throughput supporting YTC volume\n✅ B-GAE: Grant applications submitted\n✅ Burn: ≤$500/month sustained\n\nAlphaStream Unlock Decision:\nIf YTC revenue signals are materializing → evaluate AlphaStream as non-dilutive funding source.\nAlphaStream hold: tied to Portfolio Pilot gates (M1: Sep 2026, M2: Oct 2026)\n\nDecision log must be recorded. Aegis governance review.
CATEGORIES:Portfolio Pilot,Gate Review,AlphaStream
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pp-ytc-first-revenue@appdev.local
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:💰 YTC — First Revenue Transaction TARGET
DESCRIPTION:Target date for first confirmed paid revenue transaction from YouTube Creator App.\n\nAcceptable revenue sources:\n• YouTube Partner Program payment\n• Affiliate commission\n• Sponsor payment\n• Lead capture conversion\n• Paid mixing/editing referral from Studio\n\nThis milestone unlocks Phase 2 planning and validates the non-negotiable funding engine assumption.
CATEGORIES:YTC,Revenue,Milestone
PRIORITY:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

